.PP
eliminates the elements that are not contained in 'old_and_new_elmt_ids' from the \fBVSet\fP, returning mapping of old to new node idx (0\&.\&.n-1) The original \fBVSet\fP is condensed to the elements stored as keys (first arg) in the supplied map\&. Also, only the nodes connected to these elements are retained\&. 
.br

.PP
As a second step the elements and nodes are renumbered contiguously and corresponding amendments are made to the pfverts, plist and node arrays\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
