.br
\fIo_n_node_ids\fP old->new node idx mapping (0\&.\&.n-1) but only for the nodes that are kept (output)
.RE
.PP
.SH "Input Arguments"
.PP
The supplied map must contain the new element IDs (0\&.\&.n) accessible via the old element IDs (x\&.\&.y) depending on which regions were chopped away or selected from the entire model\&. In the original design, the map is output from the \fBModelTopology\fP class\&. 
.br
